%% Rework sequence — resume/fork on LangGraph
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant O as Orchestrator_LangGraph
  participant CP as Checkpointer
  participant S as SkillPhase
  U->>O: revise via Approval or new input
  O->>O: Command resume or update_state fork
  CP-->>O: lineage via checkpointer
  O->>O: inject revision into state
  O->>S: rerun affected skill node
  S-->>O: new artifact version
  Note over O,CP: auto checkpoint
  O-->>U: updated progress
